# #5833. An activation arms at the partition without the lazy claim: a partition the
# batched arm skipped. Nothing reported the other activations' appends to it, so it
# passes one. It edits the Armed predicate, not an action, so it names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestArmWithoutClaim
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an activation arms at the partition without claiming there

--- FIND
Armed(a) ==
    /\ claimed[a]

--- REPLACE
Armed(a) ==
\* MUTATION: armed without a claim at the partition.

--- END
